  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt R&#xe4;ddningstj&#xe4;nst</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rescue Service Baltic - Rescue Service Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-operation between the Swedish Rescue Services Agency and its parters in the baltic counties aiming to develop a modern rescue service, training and education, exchange of experience in research etc, during the period 1999-2001. The co-operation has been going on since 1991.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete mellan det svenska r&#xe4;ddningsverket och dess motsvarighet i de baltiska staterna f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; till st&#xe5;nd en modern r&#xe4;ddningsservice med effektiva system f&#xf6;r tr&#xe4;ning och utbildning, erfarenhetsutbyten vg forskningsresultat etc. Perioden g&#xe4;ller 1999-2001, men samarbetet har p&#xe5;g&#xe5;tt sedan 1991.</narrative>
  </description>
